{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>My Lord Is Hiring</i>, players take the reins as the hiring manager for a medieval kingdom. It\u2019s up to you to manage your nation\u2019s income, resources, and workers to ensure the kingdom is well-defended against monsters and flourishing financially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of soldiers, healers, and craftspeople desperate for work, you\u2019ll need to hire wisely to ensure you\u2019re finding the best of the best and supporting the good people of the kingdom along the way. Try not to fall for the charms of liars and cheats, or get caught up in the budding family drama of the different employees that may join your ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good hiring manager will scour through resumes and job applications, consult their advisor, and send new hires off to work, all while managing their budget and resources. So, will you help your kingdom flourish? Or will you send your people to ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/9f5299649650de07c8721ddf5a508dc2.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze resumes, ask questions, consult your advisor, and trust your instincts to decide who\u2019s fit for Combat, Trade, or Support. Hiring an untrustworthy candidate is bad for business, but sometimes taking a risk on a potential hire can be well worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/549812b2be795849b9b6c95b86cbf72d.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/16c8a7ee78320b29c4a9386fd213a407.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/16c8a7ee78320b29c4a9386fd213a407.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/16c8a7ee78320b29c4a9386fd213a407.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your team for combat, then watch as they engage in fast-paced auto battles. Each unit follows an attack pattern that builds energy to unleash their Ultimate. You can intervene at critical moments to save a life\u2014or end one. Strategy and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/ad89ce8bb08bfd39f8f1d8ac95f101a0.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/8ce5e0767fde351ef4b8f3203bc03e0c.avif?t=1768765608\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras_big/8ce5e0767fde351ef4b8f3203bc03e0c.avif?t=1768765608 width=800 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're sending Knights, Archers, and Clerics to vanquish demons or employing Miners, Farmers, and Lumberjacks to gather resources, every decision matters. Quests require careful thought, so choose the right team and equip them with crafted gear to boost their chance of success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/a628087837edb2114a02a0fe9401b0a9.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your tradespeople out to gather materials you can use to craft powerful weapons and potions. Experiment with rare recipes to see what you can create. Then it\u2019s up to you to decide whether to strengthen your team with your new creations or sell them to expand your payroll.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/1b9eb64c0ac660e53f58ac73ec7fc0e5.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make influences the story and your chances for success. Will you fall for a con man\u2019s sob story? Or play favorites by hiring a current employee\u2019s family members? Or will you assemble a team of complete misfits to see what comes from the chaos? With a complicated cast of unique characters up for hire, there are many ways to improve\u2014or destroy\u2014your kingdom. Which will you choose?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2479630?t=1768765608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2479630?t=1768765608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768765608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768765608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>My Lord Is Hiring</i>, players take the reins as the hiring manager for a medieval kingdom. It\u2019s up to you to manage your nation\u2019s income, resources, and workers to ensure the kingdom is well-defended against monsters and flourishing financially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of soldiers, healers, and craftspeople desperate for work, you\u2019ll need to hire wisely to ensure you\u2019re finding the best of the best and supporting the good people of the kingdom along the way. Try not to fall for the charms of liars and cheats, or get caught up in the budding family drama of the different employees that may join your ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good hiring manager will scour through resumes and job applications, consult their advisor, and send new hires off to work, all while managing their budget and resources. So, will you help your kingdom flourish? Or will you send your people to ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/9f5299649650de07c8721ddf5a508dc2.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/665f5276361ac434845150cb535bcfc6.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze resumes, ask questions, consult your advisor, and trust your instincts to decide who\u2019s fit for Combat, Trade, or Support. Hiring an untrustworthy candidate is bad for business, but sometimes taking a risk on a potential hire can be well worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/549812b2be795849b9b6c95b86cbf72d.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img