s/a628087837edb2114a02a0fe9401b0a9.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/45446d39328fc5bd405aef32c0bcf329.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your tradespeople out to gather materials you can use to craft powerful weapons and potions. Experiment with rare recipes to see what you can create. Then it\u2019s up to you to decide whether to strengthen your team with your new creations or sell them to expand your payroll.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/1b9eb64c0ac660e53f58ac73ec7fc0e5.avif?t=1768765608\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.poster.avif?t=1768765608\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.webm?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/extras/deed07668a08ba0533b95b9689d53b1a.mp4?t=1768765608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make influences the story and your chances for success. Will you fall for a con man\u2019s sob story? Or play favorites by hiring a current employee\u2019s family members? Or will you assemble a team of complete misfits to see what comes from the chaos? With a complicated cast of unique characters up for hire, there are many ways to improve\u2014or destroy\u2014your kingdom. Which will you choose?</p>","developers":["Team Saikou"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479630/header.jpg?t=1768765608","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2479630/2128270105/f7cfc235ee29e9c1b1f887e31b72f1cddeadd700/1750923342/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748199452","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2479630/2128270105/f7cfc235ee29e9c1b1f887e31b72f1cddeadd700/1750923342/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748199452","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2479630/2128270105/f7cfc235ee29e9c1b1f887e31b72f1cddeadd700/1750923342/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748199452","id":257062737,"name":"My Lord Is Hiring - Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257062737/34acf333def801217db85265e556ea026b945edc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748199452"}],"name":"My Lord Is Hiring","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></